{'symbol': 'MLM', 'date': '2022-11-10 14:37:00', 'title': 'MARTIN MARIETTA DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': "RALEIGH, N.C., NOV. 10, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MARTIN MARIETTA MATERIALS, INC. (NYSE: MLM) (“MARTIN MARIETTA” OR THE “COMPANY”) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.66 PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY'S OUTSTANDING COMMON STOCK. THIS DIVIDEND, WHICH REPRESENTS A CASH DIVIDEND OF $2.64 PER SHARE ON AN ANNUALIZED BASIS, IS PAYABLE DECEMBER 30, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 1, 2022"}